{"bundle_id":"search.ae57ab49887aaa92d6a8","facts":[{"description":"Whether the particular fund is authorised by the SFC for offering to the public in Hong Kong at the assessment time.; units: Boolean fund-scope fact","name":"sfc_authorised_public_fund","type":"bool"},{"description":"Whether the particular fund falls within the listed closed-ended alternative asset fund category excluded by footnote 6. An unresolved category classification remains unknown.; units: Boolean exclusion fact","name":"listed_closed_ended_alternative_asset_fund","type":"bool"},{"description":"Whether established total direct and indirect exposure to private market assets amounts to at least 50% of the Fund's NAV at the assessment time. Supplying this fact requires resolving applicable exposure measurement and aggregation; missing holdings or measurement evidence is not false.; units: Boolean inclusive 50%-of-NAV threshold fact","name":"aggregate_private_market_exposure_at_least_half_nav","type":"bool"},{"description":"Whether an actual SFC case-by-case designation of the particular Fund as a complex product applies at the assessment time. Mere risk factors, possible designation or an unsearched designation history do not establish a positive or negative value.; units: Boolean applicable-designation fact","name":"applicable_sfc_complex_product_designation","type":"bool"}],"interpretations":[{"basis":"reviewer_interpretation","id":"reading","issue_ids":[],"source_span_ids":["s.d4148dd852cee.u4.564","s.d4148dd852cee.u63.8691","s.d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","s.d4148dd852cee.u29.4630","s.d4148dd852cee.u64.8910","s.d4148dd852cee.u32.4805","s.d4148dd852cee.u49.6955"],"statement":"Unreviewed interpretation: [TRUE_IS_SATISFIED] For an SFC-authorised fund offered to the public in Hong Kong that is not a listed closed-ended alternative asset fund, the classification trigger is satisfied when its aggregate direct and indirect exposure to private market assets is at least 50% of NAV, or when the SFC has actually designated it as a complex product on a case-by-case basis. True means that this circular supplies a basis requiring complex-product treatment for distribution. False, within scope and with the relevant facts established, means that neither classification route is established under this selected control; it does not establish non-complex status under every other applicable rule. Missing exposure or designation evidence remains unknown. The retained text supports one classification structure; the principal unresolved issues concern exposure measurement, timing and evidence, rather than a competing rule making every private-market exposure automatically complex."}],"rules":[{"body":{"args":[{"name":"aggregate_private_market_exposure_at_least_half_nav","node_id":"body.2","op":"fact"},{"name":"applicable_sfc_complex_product_designation","node_id":"body.3","op":"fact"}],"node_id":"body.1","op":"any"},"id":"selected.control","interpretation_id":"reading","scope":{"args":[{"name":"sfc_authorised_public_fund","node_id":"scope.2","op":"fact"},{"arg":{"name":"listed_closed_ended_alternative_asset_fund","node_id":"scope.4","op":"fact"},"node_id":"scope.3","op":"not"}],"node_id":"scope.1","op":"all"},"source_span_ids":["s.d4148dd852cee.u4.564","s.d4148dd852cee.u63.8691","s.d4148dd852cee.u21.3779","s.d4148dd852cee.u29.4630","s.d4148dd852cee.u64.8910","s.d4148dd852cee.u32.4805","s.d4148dd852cee.u49.6955"],"type":"bool"}],"source_spans":[{"end":1019,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u4.564","page":1,"quote_sha256":"42da29771477e156f8ea238b1c08004b7d8cc9e015bf108cd907a90eb3e11556","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d1c","source_id":"d4148dd852cee","start":564,"text_sha256":"cff1139c8cfb97e3e6b3e59caae8de37328dd835dc65a207afbd6b6dbe01ffc6"},{"end":8907,"id":"s.d4148dd852cee.u63.8691","page":1,"quote_sha256":"47e613f2b646a1ccb72ca4ff11655cb9845d160c9b96350e142c185dd17ba827","raw_sha256":"7bb927fa9442eaaf0f98d0e236c3899b86db10cfcd635879bbccf8bd45a20d